---
import data from '../../../data/templates/sorbetpei.json';

const formules = data.prive.map((p, i) => ({
  ...p,
  bg: ['#FFE4B8', '#FFD9E1', '#FFF3B8'][i] ?? '#FFE4B8',
  accent: ['#FFB347', '#FF6F91', '#FFD93D'][i] ?? '#FFB347',
  photo: ['/images/glacier/privatisation-1.webp', '/images/glacier/privatisation-2.webp', '/images/glacier/privatisation-3.webp'][i],
}));
---
<section id="prive" class="relative py-24 md:py-36" style="background:#FFB347;">
  <div class="max-w-content mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between gap-6 mb-14 md:mb-20">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.42em] mb-3 font-bold flex items-center gap-3" style="color:#3D2817;">
          <span class="block w-10 h-px" style="background:#3D2817;"></span>
          Privatisation
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-fraunces leading-[0.92] tracking-[-0.015em]" style="font-size:clamp(40px,6vw,84px); color:#3D2817;">
          Le camion,
          <span class="block italic" style="color:#FFF6E2; font-size:clamp(54px,7.8vw,108px);">pour votre événement.</span>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="max-w-md text-base leading-relaxed" style="font-family:'DM Sans',system-ui,sans-serif; color:#3D2817;">
        On débarque, on installe le bar à glaces, on sert vos invités, on remballe. Une présence solaire qui change un peu des bouchées sucrées.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 md:gap-6">
      {formules.map((f, i) => (
        <li class="group relative rounded-[28px] overflow-hidden flex flex-col transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1" style={`background:${f.bg}; color:#3D2817;`}>
          <div class="relative overflow-hidden aspect-[5/4]">
            <img src={f.photo} alt={f.titre} class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-[1.05]" loading="lazy" />
            <span class="absolute top-4 left-4 inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] font-bold" style={`background:${f.accent}; color:#3D2817;`}>
              Formule {String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-7 flex-1 flex flex-col">
            <h3 class="font-fraunces text-2xl md:text-3xl leading-tight">{f.titre}</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 font-fraunces italic text-xl leading-tight" style={`color:${f.accent === '#FFD93D' ? '#FF6F91' : f.accent};`}>— {f.tagline}</p>
            <p class="mt-4 text-[14px] leading-relaxed flex-1" style="font-family:'DM Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;">{f.details}</p>
            <p class="mt-5 text-[11.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] font-bold" style="color:#5C3A1E; font-family:'DM Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;">— Réservation {f.minimum}</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>

    <!-- Atelier kids -->
    <div class="mt-16 md:mt-20 grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center p-8 md:p-12 rounded-[32px]" style="background:#3D2817; color:#FFF6E2;">
      <div class="lg:col-span-6">
        <p class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.42em] mb-3 font-bold" style="color:#FFD93D;">— Atelier kids · mercredi après-midi</p>
        <h3 class="font-fraunces italic leading-[0.95]" style="font-size:clamp(34px,4.8vw,64px);">
          Les enfants
          <span class="block" style="color:#FFD93D;">turbinent eux-mêmes.</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed max-w-lg" style="font-family:'DM Sans',system-ui,sans-serif; color:#E8DFC9;">
          Un mercredi par mois, six enfants (7-12 ans) accompagnés d'un parent. On pèle, on mixe, on tourne la turbine, on goûte. 90 minutes, un bac par binôme à emporter.
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-7 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-[13px]" style="font-family:'DM Sans',system-ui,sans-serif; color:#E8DFC9;">
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span style="color:#FFD93D;">✦</span>1er mercredi du mois · 14 h</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span style="color:#FFD93D;">✦</span>6 binômes maximum</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span style="color:#FFD93D;">✦</span>32 € par binôme</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span style="color:#FFD93D;">✦</span>1 bac 500 ml offert</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
        <img src="/images/glacier/atelier-kids.webp" alt="Atelier enfants — mains qui versent la pulpe dans la turbine" class="rounded-[24px] aspect-square object-cover" loading="lazy" />
        <img src="/images/glacier/privatisation-1.webp" alt="Cornets à la sortie de l'atelier" class="rounded-[24px] aspect-square object-cover mt-8" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Portrait Léna -->
    <div class="mt-16 md:mt-20 grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="relative">
          <img src="/images/glacier/glaciere.webp" alt={`Portrait de ${data.info.fondatrice}, glacière`} class="w-full aspect-[4/5] object-cover rounded-[28px]" loading="lazy" />
          <div class="absolute -bottom-5 -right-5 md:-right-8 w-32 h-32 md:w-36 md:h-36 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-center -rotate-12 shadow-[0_18px_44px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.25)]" style="background:#FFD93D; color:#3D2817;">
            <span class="font-fraunces italic text-2xl leading-tight px-2">Léna<br/>{data.info.annee}</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <p class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.42em] mb-3 font-bold" style="color:#3D2817;">— la glacière</p>
        <h3 class="font-fraunces leading-[0.95]" style="font-size:clamp(36px,5vw,68px); color:#3D2817;">
          Léna B.,
          <span class="block italic" style="color:#FF6F91; font-size:clamp(46px,6.6vw,90px);">la dame du camion.</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-6 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-2xl" style="font-family:'DM Sans',system-ui,sans-serif; color:#3D2817;">
          Léna a démarré le camion en 2021 après dix ans en cuisine de restaurant. Frustrée de voir les fruits péi finir en sirop industriel, elle a investi dans une turbine, un camion d'occase, et le tour était joué. Aujourd'hui, elle parcourt 220 km par semaine.
        </p>
        <blockquote class="mt-7 font-fraunces italic text-2xl md:text-3xl leading-snug border-l-2 pl-5 max-w-xl" style="border-color:#FF6F91; color:#3D2817;">
          “Une mangue Carotte des Hauts ne mérite pas un sirop industriel. Elle mérite mieux.”
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
